# ceil c070: families 8x7-070 with the e88 ceiling-held top (lever ON at rest on the TM puller).
# 8x7: x -3..4, y -2..4. Left: double horizontal pullers SE(-3,1)+SE(-2,1) (ML left then down by
# SU(-1,-1), C pulled left 2), BL down SU(0,-2), BM down SU(1,-2), MR/BR right. Rest ideal.
